8,All In The Language Family: The Sino-Tibetan Languages,https://www.babbel.com/en/magazine/sino-tibetan-language-family,"Sino-Tibetan languages are also known as Trans-Himalayan. This might offer a clearer picture of where the languages are spoken: all over China, Burma, Tibet and across the Himalayas to small parts of India, Nepal and Bhutan.",Burmese,Sino-Tibetan
